If, however, you rebuild, modify, or fork this software, you MUST remove or replace
the secforge branding before distributing it. Specifically:

  - assets/logo.svg and assets/logo-white.svg      (the logo artwork)
  - src/client_agent/logo_png.h                    (the embedded logo header;
    regenerate it from your own artwork with tools/update-logo.sh)
  - assets/screenshot.png                          (shows the logo and name)
  - any use of the "secforge" name in the UI or documentation

The logo is compiled into tsw_agent.exe, so a binary you build yourself carries the
secforge mark until you replace the artwork and regenerate logo_png.h.
